#==============================================================================================
#
#   page_client - Web::PageClient's virtual functions: the defaults of the ones a client may
#   leave alone, and the pure virtual ones every client overrides
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of the PageClient virtual functions of Libraries/LibWeb/Page/Page.h (lines
#       371-497). A function with a default body (`{ }` or `return {};`) answers that default;
#       a pure virtual one (`= 0`) traps when a client does not override it.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2020-2022, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
#==============================================================================================

